    {
      "name": "04-check",
      "path": "/drive/quick-eye-check",
      "text": "Before you drive · 3 of 3\n\nQuick eye check\n\nLook ahead, then blink twice. This adjusts to the light in your car today.\n\nBlink twice\n\n1 of 2\n\nLooked ahead for 3 seconds\n\nBlink twice\n\nReady to drive\n\nStart driving",
      "width": 430,
      "fonts": true,
